# Identity Arbiter BTS

Stage 7 tests a deduction gate where the answer is not any single document but the contradiction between two of them.

Miss Vane and Miss Marchmain are tied until the alibi statement and the torn letter are both pinned on the evidence board and CONNECTED. The alibi swears Miss Marchmain sailed from Harwick on the 12th; her own letter is postmarked Harwick the 14th. Connecting them records `7.alibi_contradiction_pinned`, marks Marchmain as contradicted, and still requires the player to commit Miss Vane before the stage clears.

The vertical slice keeps the evidence local and accessible while preserving the intended detective action: no one document lies on its face — read them against each other.
